#: src/text_evolver/templates/setting.html:142
msgid "Text Evolver - this website allows you to alter content of your text-based files in certain ways"
msgstr "Text Evolver - this website allows you to alter content of your text-based files in certain ways"

#: src/text_evolver/templates/setting.html:143
msgid "The way text will be altered is based on \"setting\" that you create and is connected yo your account"
msgstr "The way text will be altered is based on \"setting\" that you create and is connected yo your account"

#: src/text_evolver/templates/setting.html:145
msgid "Name of setting: it's the way your setting will be named and viewed in \"My settings\" and when you search"
msgstr "Name of setting: it's the way your setting will be named and viewed in \"My settings\" and when you search"

#: src/text_evolver/templates/setting.html:146
msgid "Publicity of setting: determines if your setting can be founded by users in search"
msgstr "Publicity of setting: determines if your setting can be founded by users in search"

#: src/text_evolver/templates/setting.html:147
msgid ""
"Clean empty of setting: determines if to clean lines without actual meaning (only symbols - no letters or "
"digits) in the text"
msgstr ""
"Clean empty of setting: determines if to clean lines without actual meaning (only symbols - no letters or "
"digits) in the text"

#: src/text_evolver/templates/setting.html:148
msgid "Convert to utf of setting: determines if to convert symbols as < to their utf representation"
msgstr "Convert to utf of setting: determines if to convert symbols as < to their utf representation"

#: src/text_evolver/templates/setting.html:149
msgid "Digit separator: determines what will be recognised as a separator in decimals, only one can be chosen"
msgstr "Digit separator: determines what will be recognised as a separator in decimals, only one can be chosen"

#: src/text_evolver/templates/setting.html:150
msgid ""
"Expect feet: if you want your setting to recognise ft in the form of 6'7, choose it. They will then be "
"converted to cm by default unless you set a unit conversion from the phrase \"feet\"."
msgstr ""
"Expect feet: if you want your setting to recognise ft in the form of 6'7, choose it. They will then be "
"converted to cm by default unless you set a unit conversion from the phrase \"feet\"."

#: src/text_evolver/templates/setting.html:152
msgid "Fandom rules recognize names from the cached official data and insert matching images."
msgstr "Fandom rules recognize names from the cached official data and insert matching images."

#: src/text_evolver/templates/setting.html:153
msgid "Fandom - Activated: determines if this fandom is activated. If yes, it can heavily affect performance speed"
msgstr "Fandom - Activated: determines if this fandom is activated. If yes, it can heavily affect performance speed"

#: src/text_evolver/templates/setting.html:154
msgid ""
"Fandom - Separation: determines number of words that have to be between the same phrase to trigger image "
"insertion. If it's \"1\", it will insert image only once"
msgstr ""
"Fandom - Separation: determines number of words that have to be between the same phrase to trigger image "
"insertion. If it's \"1\", it will insert image only once"

#: src/text_evolver/templates/setting.html:155
msgid ""
"Fandom - Show height: tells if image should have this value on it (taken from official website). Won't be "
"shown if it's not possible"
msgstr ""
"Fandom - Show height: tells if image should have this value on it (taken from official website). Won't be "
"shown if it's not possible"

#: src/text_evolver/templates/setting.html:156
msgid ""
"Fandom - Show weight: tells if image should have this value on it (taken from official website). Won't be "
"shown if it's not possible"
msgstr ""
"Fandom - Show weight: tells if image should have this value on it (taken from official website). Won't be "
"shown if it's not possible"

#: src/text_evolver/templates/setting.html:158
msgid "Unit conversion: recognises a unit and then converts it to another."
msgstr "Unit conversion: recognises a unit and then converts it to another."

#: src/text_evolver/templates/setting.html:159
msgid "Unit - Initial unit: what word will be recognised and trigger change"
msgstr "Unit - Initial unit: what word will be recognised and trigger change"

#: src/text_evolver/templates/setting.html:160
msgid "Unit - New unit: the unit that unit will be replaced with"
msgstr "Unit - New unit: the unit that unit will be replaced with"

#: src/text_evolver/templates/setting.html:161
msgid "Unit - Convertation of unit: by what value number before unit will be multiplied"
msgstr "Unit - Convertation of unit: by what value number before unit will be multiplied"

#: src/text_evolver/templates/setting.html:162
msgid ""
"Unit - Can be word: if initial unit can be as well act as word and not unit, choose it. Otherwise it will "
"always change and add number before it, if there is none"
msgstr ""
"Unit - Can be word: if initial unit can be as well act as word and not unit, choose it. Otherwise it will "
"always change and add number before it, if there is none"

#: src/text_evolver/templates/setting.html:164
msgid "Image insertion: adds an image based on a phrase."
msgstr "Image insertion: adds an image based on a phrase."

#: src/text_evolver/templates/setting.html:165
msgid ""
"Image - Trigger phrase: what phrase will be recognised and trigger change (if it overlaps with fandom's "
"value, they will merge)"
msgstr ""
"Image - Trigger phrase: what phrase will be recognised and trigger change (if it overlaps with fandom's "
"value, they will merge)"

#: src/text_evolver/templates/setting.html:166
msgid ""
"Image - Separation: determines number of words that have to be between the same phrase to trigger image "
"insertion. If it's \"1\", it will insert image only once"
msgstr ""
"Image - Separation: determines number of words that have to be between the same phrase to trigger image "
"insertion. If it's \"1\", it will insert image only once"

#: src/text_evolver/templates/setting.html:167
msgid ""
"Image - Explanation: a phrase that will be added on image as a sort of explanation. Must be at most 64 "
"characters. If left empty, there will be none (and no space on image reserved)"
msgstr ""
"Image - Explanation: a phrase that will be added on image as a sort of explanation. Must be at most 64 "
"characters. If left empty, there will be none (and no space on image reserved)"

#: src/text_evolver/templates/setting.html:168
msgid "Image - Accept suffix: if recognition by phrase should accept having suffixes"
msgstr "Image - Accept suffix: if recognition by phrase should accept having suffixes"

#: src/text_evolver/templates/setting.html:169
msgid ""
"Image - Images: image(s) that will be added. If there are few, one will be chosen randomly. If it's merged "
"with fandom's value, image will be chosen from these and fandom's. Also, if you opened already existing "
"setting, living it empty will leave previous images and changing will set new"
msgstr ""
"Image - Images: image(s) that will be added. If there are few, one will be chosen randomly. If it's merged "
"with fandom's value, image will be chosen from these and fandom's. Also, if you opened already existing "
"setting, living it empty will leave previous images and changing will set new"

#: src/text_evolver/templates/setting.html:171
msgid "Phrase replacement: recognises a phrase and then replaces it."
msgstr "Phrase replacement: recognises a phrase and then replaces it."

#: src/text_evolver/templates/setting.html:172
msgid "Phrase - Change from: what phrase will be recognised and trigger change"
msgstr "Phrase - Change from: what phrase will be recognised and trigger change"

#: src/text_evolver/templates/setting.html:173
msgid "Phrase - Change to: on what phrase initial one will be changed"
msgstr "Phrase - Change to: on what phrase initial one will be changed"

#: src/text_evolver/templates/setting.html:174
msgid ""
"Phrase - Direct change: if chosen, change will recognise only initial phrase as it's but will as well allow"
" initial phrase to have special symbols"
msgstr ""
"Phrase - Direct change: if chosen, change will recognise only initial phrase as it's but will as well allow"
" initial phrase to have special symbols"

#: src/text_evolver/templates/setting.html:175
msgid ""
"Phrase - Accept suffix: if recognition by phrase should accept having suffixes. If direct change is chosen,"
" it's irrelevant"
msgstr ""
"Phrase - Accept suffix: if recognition by phrase should accept having suffixes. If direct change is chosen,"
" it's irrelevant"

